WEBVTT

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.134
Thanks to Annie and Archie,
who came to the mountain,

00:00:09.284 --> 00:00:14.203
Candy was making everybody happy
with the food.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.146
Meanwhile,

00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:23.648
Belle had an idea,

00:00:23.798 --> 00:00:26.818
and sneaked onto a train nearby.

00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:29.726
No one was aware of that.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:36.091
Episode 108
Sounds of joy roar in the valley.

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:55.354
Did you hear the steaming sound?

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:02.654
Come on.
You are still so young.

00:01:02.804 --> 00:01:05.310
Besides, there in only one person
who can drive start the train here.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.159
That's right.

00:01:07.309 --> 00:01:10.260
I am the only driver here.

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:14.933
Then, let's get ready to eat.

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:17.102
Where is Belle?

00:01:17.252 --> 00:01:19.404
I haven't seen her.

00:01:19.554 --> 00:01:19.571
Where has she gone?

00:01:19.721 --> 00:01:23.207
I will go find her.

00:01:24.985 --> 00:01:27.112
Kurin, have you seen Belle?

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:31.349
No? Weird...

00:01:31.499 --> 00:01:34.549
Where did she go?

00:01:34.699 --> 00:01:38.524
Kurin, follow me.
Let's go look for her.

00:01:39.674 --> 00:01:42.461
How do I start this train?

00:01:42.911 --> 00:01:44.996
Not this one.

00:01:45.146 --> 00:01:46.832
How about this one?

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:49.542
It's moving!

00:01:51.907 --> 00:01:55.542
It's moving! It's moving!

00:02:05.392 --> 00:02:07.031
This is fun!

00:02:15.392 --> 00:02:17.031
Something is wrong with the train!

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:23.941
Now I can go find mother!

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:25.770
Go, faster!

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:28.412
Faster!

00:02:35.956 --> 00:02:39.687
Belle, it's dangerous!
Stop, Belle!

00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:43.475
Stop!

00:02:53.161 --> 00:02:55.400
Stop!

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:57.802
Candy!

00:02:57.952 --> 00:03:01.172
- Belle is on the train!
- What is she doing?

00:03:01.322 --> 00:03:02.474
Mr. Nelson!

00:03:02.624 --> 00:03:06.478
It's going to fall into the valley like this!

00:03:06.628 --> 00:03:10.546
- Stop that train!
- Yes!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:30.747
- Belle!
- Candy!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:33.672
Why are you doing this?

00:03:33.822 --> 00:03:36.508
Because I want to go to mother!

00:03:36.658 --> 00:03:39.575
Mother? Belle...

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:51.195
Candy!

00:03:55.468 --> 00:04:00.701
Help!

00:04:01.541 --> 00:04:04.806
Candy! Candy!

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:12.613
The train is coming, quick!

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:20.752
- Too late!
- Help!

00:04:20.902 --> 00:04:22.754
Is that Candy?

00:04:22.904 --> 00:04:25.957
Candy is in danger!

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:32.098
Belle, can you help me?

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.901
- Candy!
- Belle, stop the train!

00:04:37.051 --> 00:04:40.672
Stop the train! Please!

00:04:40.822 --> 00:04:42.774
I am scared, Candy!

00:04:42.924 --> 00:04:45.744
I don't know how to stop it!

00:04:45.894 --> 00:04:46.945
Calm down, Belle.

00:04:47.095 --> 00:04:50.015
Listen to me.
How did you get it started?

00:04:50.165 --> 00:04:51.850
Just do the opposite!

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.619
No, I can't remember!

00:04:54.769 --> 00:04:56.755
Please, try to remember!

00:04:56.905 --> 00:05:01.267
And do the opposite!

00:05:02.202 --> 00:05:03.261
You can do it, Belle!

00:05:03.411 --> 00:05:06.231
Save me, please!

00:05:06.381 --> 00:05:08.399
Help me!

00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:15.610
Okay.

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:54.626
Candy! Candy!

00:05:55.585 --> 00:05:59.551
- Candy!
- Candy is dead!

00:05:59.701 --> 00:06:03.121
- Candy!
- Belle, it's okay.

00:06:03.271 --> 00:06:04.789
Candy isn't dead.

00:06:04.939 --> 00:06:06.336
Candy!

00:06:07.864 --> 00:06:09.861
Where is Belle?

00:06:10.011 --> 00:06:16.432
- Candy! Candy!
- Belle!

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.428
She fell asleep at last.

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:41.793
She wanted to see her mother.

00:06:42.003 --> 00:06:46.367
Yes.
She couldn't wait.

00:06:50.076 --> 00:06:53.011
She must be dreaming about
her mother.

00:06:53.279 --> 00:06:55.974
Candy, let's sleep together tonight.

00:06:56.124 --> 00:06:59.344
Yes, as if we were back
to Pony's Home.

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:04.249
When I felt lonely,

00:07:04.399 --> 00:07:07.350
I would go to Candy's bed.

00:07:34.887 --> 00:07:36.347
It's the past...

00:07:36.497 --> 00:07:38.650
I feel so ashamed to be here.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.084
Why?

00:07:40.234 --> 00:07:43.555
Patty and I were going to concerts
in Chicago.

00:07:43.705 --> 00:07:45.256
And...

00:07:45.406 --> 00:07:47.926
You Candy are working so hard here.

00:07:48.076 --> 00:07:49.894
That's not right, Annie.

00:07:50.044 --> 00:07:52.797
I like the country, I like this place.

00:07:52.947 --> 00:07:55.433
I don't want to go back to Chicago.

00:07:55.583 --> 00:07:59.205
I want to work with you here, Candy,
all the time.

00:08:10.657 --> 00:08:15.820
Right, to the left, good.

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.423
It's too dull
with just one flower pot.

00:08:18.573 --> 00:08:20.191
Neil, where are you going?

00:08:20.341 --> 00:08:21.759
I’m going out for a drive.

00:08:21.909 --> 00:08:24.362
Please remember to come back
for the party tonight.

00:08:24.512 --> 00:08:27.065
Archie and Annie will not come.

00:08:27.215 --> 00:08:28.800
They will come back tonight.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.969
Do you want to go skiing with them?

00:08:31.119 --> 00:08:33.905
You mean they didn't go skiing?

00:08:34.055 --> 00:08:36.374
My friends went to the mountains.

00:08:36.524 --> 00:08:38.543
They didn't see anyone in the villa.

00:08:38.693 --> 00:08:41.045
So, the two of them...

00:08:41.195 --> 00:08:45.488
They must have sneaked
to see Candy.

00:08:47.794 --> 00:08:49.254
Candy...

00:08:49.404 --> 00:08:51.356
I knew something was wrong!

00:08:51.506 --> 00:08:54.626
Too bad!

00:08:54.776 --> 00:08:56.861
Tonight's party will be cancelled!

00:08:57.011 --> 00:09:00.397
You'd better watch out... Candy!

00:09:00.907 --> 00:09:03.101
Annie, hurry up, it's nearly noon.

00:09:03.251 --> 00:09:04.302
Yes, yes!

00:09:04.452 --> 00:09:07.171
People here take eating seriously.

00:09:07.321 --> 00:09:11.109
- Archie looks like a real cook!
-I could open a restaurant.

00:09:11.259 --> 00:09:13.744
He is so proud.

00:09:14.053 --> 00:09:15.747
Mr. Nelson!

00:09:15.897 --> 00:09:17.882
It will be ready before noon.

00:09:18.032 --> 00:09:20.251
Are you Archie Cornwell?

00:09:20.401 --> 00:09:23.921
Are you Annie Brighton?

00:09:24.071 --> 00:09:27.358
How did you know Archie's
and Annie's full names?

00:09:27.508 --> 00:09:29.227
Just as expected.

00:09:29.377 --> 00:09:31.462
We had a telegram from the company.

00:09:31.612 --> 00:09:36.563
The main shareholder's children are not
allowed to work in the mountain.

00:09:36.713 --> 00:09:39.103
We came by ourselves.

00:09:39.253 --> 00:09:41.072
But how did they know?

00:09:41.222 --> 00:09:44.809
It must have been Eliza.

00:09:44.959 --> 00:09:47.145
Please, go back to Chicago at once.

00:09:47.295 --> 00:09:48.446
That's too rushed!

00:09:48.596 --> 00:09:50.448
They are from the Adley family.

00:09:50.598 --> 00:09:53.351
They cannot work here.

00:09:53.501 --> 00:09:55.420
Let us finish the lunch.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:59.158
Your hands.

00:10:01.768 --> 00:10:05.163
Unacceptable!
Candy, take care of her.

00:10:05.313 --> 00:10:07.999
It's ok, just some bruises.

00:10:08.149 --> 00:10:12.843
Do as I said.
Or I will fire you.

00:10:26.592 --> 00:10:28.353
Why?

00:10:28.503 --> 00:10:32.023
Why don't you let me work here?

00:10:32.173 --> 00:10:35.124
Look at this.

00:10:36.202 --> 00:10:37.729
Transfer order.

00:10:37.879 --> 00:10:39.430
Go to the set in Alaska.

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:41.499
It's an order
from the Chicago hospital?

00:10:41.649 --> 00:10:43.768
It's a notice from the company.

00:10:43.918 --> 00:10:45.970
The company has the right

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.874
to decide
where you will be sent to.

00:10:50.024 --> 00:10:51.709
But, in Alaska...

00:10:51.859 --> 00:10:55.279
You know, I could fire you,

00:10:55.429 --> 00:10:56.848
so you wouldn't have to go to Alaska.

00:10:56.998 --> 00:10:59.084
That's why, Mr. Nelson...

00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:02.553
I had my reasons.

00:11:02.703 --> 00:11:04.353
That's too much.

00:11:04.503 --> 00:11:07.956
Why would I need to
go somewhere that far?

00:11:10.069 --> 00:11:12.697
Candy, does anyone hate you so much?

00:11:12.847 --> 00:11:14.766
Hate?

00:11:14.916 --> 00:11:18.269
It must be Eliza!
She must have decided this!

00:11:18.419 --> 00:11:20.171
Don't let her bother you.

00:11:20.321 --> 00:11:21.773
Accept the facts

00:11:21.923 --> 00:11:23.926
and go back to Chicago with them.

00:11:27.787 --> 00:11:31.282
I will write a letter to the hospital
that we don't have many patients here

00:11:31.432 --> 00:11:33.084
so you can go back.

00:11:33.234 --> 00:11:34.786
No, I don't want to!

00:11:34.936 --> 00:11:37.455
So, are you going to Alaska?

00:11:37.605 --> 00:11:40.658
I will go!
I don't want to get fired!

00:11:43.603 --> 00:11:45.963
Eliza has gone too far!

00:11:46.113 --> 00:11:48.764
Why would she do such a thing?

00:11:48.914 --> 00:11:50.101
I am sorry.

00:11:50.251 --> 00:11:52.503
Archie, Annie... can you both
go back to Chicago now?

00:11:52.653 --> 00:11:54.672
If we go,
what will happen to Belle?

00:11:54.822 --> 00:11:57.272
I will ask Mr. Nelson
to look after her.

00:11:58.351 --> 00:11:59.310
Mr. Nelson...

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:01.245
The four of you, get on the train!

00:12:01.395 --> 00:12:02.747
Then, Belle...

00:12:02.897 --> 00:12:05.616
In a week, the project will be finished.

00:12:05.766 --> 00:12:08.186
then we will all go.

00:12:08.336 --> 00:12:11.087
I can go look for mom.

00:12:11.237 --> 00:12:12.723
- Belle...
- Candy!

00:12:12.873 --> 00:12:17.428
I got an idea.
We could take Belle to Pony's Home.

00:12:17.578 --> 00:12:22.066
Yes! Why didn't I think of that!

00:12:22.216 --> 00:12:24.001
Candy, get on the train!

00:12:24.151 --> 00:12:25.269
Mr. Nelson!

00:12:25.419 --> 00:12:27.209
Please, fire me!

00:12:34.854 --> 00:12:38.349
Archie can cook very well.

00:12:38.499 --> 00:12:40.218
Sorry to bring you so much trouble.

00:12:40.368 --> 00:12:42.987
That's ok.
Take care of Belle, Candy.

00:12:43.137 --> 00:12:45.756
Yes.
Take care, Mr. Nelson!

00:12:45.906 --> 00:12:49.694
I am ok.
Belle, good luck.

00:12:50.844 --> 00:12:53.364
Mr. Nelson.
We will go now.

00:12:55.514 --> 00:12:58.199
Thanks for everything.

00:13:02.349 --> 00:13:06.150
- Goodbye, Mr. Nelson! Goodbye!
- Thank you.

00:13:09.522 --> 00:13:12.514
Goodbye!

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:28.065
We came here to help you, Candy,
but we put you in trouble instead.

00:13:28.215 --> 00:13:32.303
Of course not!
It was nice working with you both!

00:13:32.453 --> 00:13:36.314
I never expected to work with you, Candy!

00:13:38.718 --> 00:13:40.211
Candy! Candy!

00:13:40.361 --> 00:13:42.846
Look at that!

00:13:51.697 --> 00:13:54.325
It's dark...

00:13:54.475 --> 00:13:56.527
Why is it so dark?

00:13:56.677 --> 00:13:58.627
The light in the kitchen is on.

00:14:02.006 --> 00:14:06.744
- Mr. Nelson! What are you doing?
- Can't you see what I am doing?

00:14:13.285 --> 00:14:15.685
What's going on?

00:14:25.331 --> 00:14:28.192
Mother, it's mother!

00:14:28.342 --> 00:14:30.328
Belle!

00:14:30.478 --> 00:14:32.196
Mother, mother is back!

00:14:32.346 --> 00:14:34.603
- Mother!
- Belle...

00:14:37.877 --> 00:14:41.813
Watch out!
Get away!

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:59.959
Are you all right?
Margot! It's Margot!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.867
- Margot!
- Mother!

00:15:06.372 --> 00:15:10.768
Margot, are you ok?

00:15:10.918 --> 00:15:15.806
- Belle...
- Mother!

00:15:15.956 --> 00:15:20.511
She is ok.
Take her to the clinic now.

00:15:24.123 --> 00:15:25.516
Has she escaped?

00:15:25.666 --> 00:15:26.484
No.

00:15:26.634 --> 00:15:28.753
The jury sympathised with
Margot's suffering

00:15:28.903 --> 00:15:30.388
and let her go free of guilt.

00:15:30.538 --> 00:15:31.555
That's great!

00:15:31.705 --> 00:15:32.723
Mr. Nelson,

00:15:32.873 --> 00:15:35.493
is there any seat left
for tomorrow's first train?

00:15:35.643 --> 00:15:37.294
The first train?

00:15:37.444 --> 00:15:39.563
I want to go back to Chicago
as soon as possible

00:15:39.713 --> 00:15:42.400
to cancel Candy's transfer order
to Alaska.

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:44.001
Margot is back already.

00:15:44.151 --> 00:15:45.903
Eliza is my peer.

00:15:46.053 --> 00:15:48.506
So I have the same rights as her.

00:15:48.656 --> 00:15:51.141
I see.
Let me arrange it.

00:16:06.832 --> 00:16:10.194
Is this ok?
Not sending your friend away?

00:16:10.344 --> 00:16:12.863
We said goodbye just now.

00:16:13.013 --> 00:16:15.633
Candy, thanks for your caring.

00:16:15.783 --> 00:16:17.601
This is my job.

00:16:17.751 --> 00:16:21.072
Margot, you must get well soon
and cook some nice dishes.

00:16:21.222 --> 00:16:26.010
I wonder if everyone
has something to eat.

00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:29.547
I must work hard.

00:16:29.697 --> 00:16:30.781
No matter what others say,

00:16:30.931 --> 00:16:34.223
I will not leave
before the project is finished.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.490
I will work hard!

00:17:02.888 --> 00:17:05.483
No fractures...
So don't worry.

00:17:05.633 --> 00:17:08.619
- Really?
- You were too careless.

00:17:08.769 --> 00:17:10.621
Be more careful!

00:17:10.771 --> 00:17:13.124
Go back to work!

00:17:13.274 --> 00:17:14.291
Mr. Nelson,

00:17:14.441 --> 00:17:16.494
Mario needs some rest.

00:17:16.644 --> 00:17:18.529
What? It's just a scratch!

00:17:18.679 --> 00:17:20.264
No slacking.

00:17:20.414 --> 00:17:22.700
We don't have time to rest now.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:25.903
Mario, get back to work!

00:17:26.053 --> 00:17:27.404
Mr. Nelson!

00:17:27.554 --> 00:17:30.873
You can't do this! Mr. Nelson!

00:17:31.023 --> 00:17:33.811
Candy, didn't you say
you want to get fired?

00:17:33.961 --> 00:17:38.783
How can you not have a nurse
in such a dangerous place?

00:17:38.933 --> 00:17:40.689
Don't be rude.

00:17:44.396 --> 00:17:46.190
Here, the last one.

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:48.159
Thank you for helping me.

00:17:48.309 --> 00:17:49.593
The weather is so good, Candy.

00:17:49.743 --> 00:17:53.030
It seems that spring is coming.

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:54.398
Candy!

00:17:54.548 --> 00:17:55.900
Mr. Nelson is looking for you!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.102
Nagging again?

00:18:00.779 --> 00:18:03.207
Why would he want me to come here?

00:18:03.357 --> 00:18:06.177
You are in trouble!

00:18:06.327 --> 00:18:09.653
Is Mr. Nelson angry?

00:18:12.524 --> 00:18:15.352
Why are all of you standing there?

00:18:15.502 --> 00:18:17.354
Candy, come here!

00:18:17.504 --> 00:18:19.390
Yes, but...

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:22.298
Candy, Mr. Nelson wants to see you.

00:18:23.335 --> 00:18:25.329
Right, stop there.

00:18:25.479 --> 00:18:28.632
Candy, there is a handle on the box,
press it hard.

00:18:28.782 --> 00:18:30.601
Handle on the box?

00:18:30.751 --> 00:18:32.369
Quick! Press it hard!

00:18:32.519 --> 00:18:35.743
Candy, don't be scared.

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:04.541
We did it!

00:19:05.577 --> 00:19:07.177
Candy, look!

00:19:11.177 --> 00:19:13.177
The tunnel is open!

00:19:22.594 --> 00:19:24.255
Candy.

00:19:24.405 --> 00:19:28.125
Mr. Nelson asked you Candy,
to press the handle.

00:19:28.275 --> 00:19:29.426
Mr. Nelson...

00:19:29.576 --> 00:19:33.163
The reason is because
you have worked the hardest.

00:19:33.313 --> 00:19:35.468
I worked the hardest?

00:19:36.108 --> 00:19:39.334
I am... I am so touched!

00:19:39.484 --> 00:19:42.373
- Good job, everyone!
- You too.

00:19:42.523 --> 00:19:45.349
Let's celebrate tonight!

00:19:59.231 --> 00:20:01.725
Candy, the order from Chicago.

00:20:03.475 --> 00:20:05.729
"Come back to Chicago hospital
and resume your post."

00:20:05.879 --> 00:20:07.665
"Before this,
you have a week holiday."

00:20:07.815 --> 00:20:12.069
Archie must have contacted the company.

00:20:12.219 --> 00:20:14.571
Candy, it's time to go out.

00:20:14.721 --> 00:20:16.573
If you have a boyfriend.

00:20:16.723 --> 00:20:18.142
That's too much!

00:20:18.292 --> 00:20:22.279
- That's great, Candy.
- Belle say my name again!

00:20:22.429 --> 00:20:27.155
- Candy!
- I am so happy, Belle!

00:20:32.364 --> 00:20:34.258
Thank you very much!

00:20:34.408 --> 00:20:36.627
Candy, the next time you come
to this tunnel,

00:20:36.777 --> 00:20:38.562
it might be on your honeymoon.

00:20:38.712 --> 00:20:39.930
My honeymoon?

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:43.100
You can go by train.

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:45.002
You got to find yourself a man first!

00:20:45.152 --> 00:20:48.308
Oh please, Mr. Mario!

00:20:50.816 --> 00:20:52.977
Everyone, goodbye!

00:20:53.252 --> 00:20:57.848
- Goodbye!
- Goodbye!

00:21:00.926 --> 00:21:06.230
Candy left with some great memories
from Graytown.

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:10.894
In a week's time, the project will be
finished and everyone will leave.

00:21:11.044 --> 00:21:15.929
Even the clinic will move
somewhere else.

00:21:16.269 --> 00:21:21.929
Candy is enjoying her holiday
and is on her way back to Pony's Home.

00:21:23.269 --> 00:21:25.929
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by fofiko1 and Rémi
